{
  "info": {
    "name": "RobinKeyz — Management",
    "description": "Static content blocks: about, terms, privacy.\n\n### Setup\nSelect the **RobinKeyz — Local** environment, then send **Login** from the *RobinKeyz — Auth* collection once.\n\n`type` is unique in the database and the service uses **upsert**, so sending the same `type` twice updates the existing row instead of creating a second one.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Management",
      "description": "Static content blocks: about, terms, privacy.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create / Update — About (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('type is about', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.type).to.eql('about');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"about\",\n  \"description\": \"RobinKeyz LLC is a software company based in Dhaka, Bangladesh. We build web and mobile applications for clients around the world.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/management/create",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "management",
                "create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin only.\n\n| Field | Rule |\n|---|---|\n| `type` | one of `about`, `terms`, `privacy` |\n| `description` | not empty |\n\n**Expected:** 201.\n\nAs a non-admin: 403 — `You are not authorized.` Without a token: 401."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create / Update — Terms (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"terms\",\n  \"description\": \"By using this service you agree to our terms and conditions. You must be at least 18 years old.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/management/create",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "management",
                "create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Expected:** 201."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create / Update — Privacy (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"privacy\",\n  \"description\": \"We collect only the data required to operate this service: your name, email and phone number. We never sell your data to third parties.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/management/create",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "management",
                "create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Expected:** 201."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create — Invalid Type (400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"contact\",\n  \"description\": \"This should fail because contact is not an allowed type.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/management/create",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "management",
                "create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Expected:** 400 — `Type must be one of: about, terms, privacy`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get by Type (public)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('a single object is returned', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data).to.not.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/management?type=about",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "management"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "about",
                  "description": "about | terms | privacy"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public — no token needed. This is what the website's About / Terms / Privacy pages call.\n\nWith `?type=` a **single object** comes back. Drop the param and you get every row as an array.\n\n**Expected:** 200. A type that has not been created yet: 404 — `No privacy description found.`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All (public)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/management",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "management"
              ]
            },
            "description": "No `type` param, so every row comes back as an array.\n\n**Expected:** 200 with `data: [...]`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List with pagination (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('pagination is present', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().pagination).to.have.property('totalItem');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apiUrl}}/management/list?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": [
                "{{apiUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "management",
                "list"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10"
                },
                {
                  "key": "searchTerm",
                  "value": "dhaka",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Matches type and description"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "-updatedAt",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "fields",
                  "value": "type,description",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Return only these columns"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin only. Same QueryBuilder as the user list, so search, sort, field picking and pagination all work.\n\nTick the greyed-out params in the **Params** tab to try them.\n\n**Expected:** 200 with a `pagination` block."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
